OL,3,GWales                                  
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry with     
OL,6,Fclear skies tonight, and it will be a  
OL,7,Fchillier night than last night with    
OL,8,Fwinds falling light, allowing a fairly 
OL,9,Fwidespread frost to develop. Chance of 
OL,10,Fisolated freezing fog patches forming  
OL,11,Fin places by dawn.                     
OL,13,CSaturday:FAfter a frosty start,        
OL,14,Ftomorrow will be dry and chilly with   
OL,15,Fsunny spells, while fog may linger     
OL,16,Finland. Winds start to pick up near    
OL,17,Fcoasts in the evening.                 
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
