OL,3,GWales                                  
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FWet and 
OL,6,Fwindy weather arrives on Sunday        
OL,7,Fmorning, with a dry and cloudy day in  
OL,8,Fnorthern areas. Monday and Tuesday     
OL,9,Fwill be showery with heavy downpours   
OL,10,Fpossible. Turning milder.              
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
